  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">POD Norwegian Participation in International Police Operations 2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norwegian police participation in international police operations 2021. A significant emphasis is placed on recruiting female police officers, and all the projects and missions involved receive a special focus to follow up on the 1325 agenda. The results are reported to the Norwegian Strategic plan to follow up on Women, Peace and Development.</narrative>
  </description>
